<title>FRANCE: Former Vietnamese Emperor Bao dai dead - French TV.</title>
<headline>Former Vietnamese Emperor Bao dai dead - French TV.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deposed Vietnamese Emperor Bao Dai has died  in a French military hospital in Paris, French television said on  Friday. He was 83.</p>
<p>Bao Dai, who ruled with French support through the 1940s and the first  half of the 1950s, had lived in exile in southern France for more  than 40 years.  </p>
<p>Bao Dai, who was born in the former Vietnamese imperial capital Hue,  had no longer played any political role in his country's affairs.</p>
</text>
